SUMMARY:Wild Horse Nine
LOCATION:Triplex Cinema\, 70 Railroad St\, Great Barrington\, MA 01230
DESCRIPTION:Times: 12pm\, 5:15pm\, 7:45pm\nShortly before the 1973 Chilean 
 coup\, CIA agents Chris and Lee are dispatched from Santiago to Easter Isl
 and by their bureau chief\, MJ. Amongst the Island's iconic statues\, and 
 as the longtime partners wrestle with their dark pasts and present conspir
 acies\, Chris's newfound bond with a pair of rebellious students threatens
  to send everyone’s trip to this remote paradise sideways.\nhttps://www.
 thetriplex.org/movie/wild-horse-nine\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://p
 ushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.thetriplex.org/movie/wild-horse-nine
END:VEVENT
