SUMMARY:The Only Living Pickpocket in New York
LOCATION:Triplex Cinema\, 70 Railroad St\, Great Barrington\, MA 01230
DESCRIPTION:Harry Lehman is an aging pickpocket who plies his trade with ev
 er-diminishing returns in a drastically changed New York. Wallets stuffed 
 with cash have been replaced by easily cancelled credit cards\, and Harry 
 struggles to make ends meet as he cares for his disabled wife\, Rosie. Whe
 n he unwittingly purloins and fences a valuable USB stick\, Harry finds hi
 mself in a race against time to return the loot or face the rage of a veng
 eful crime family.\nhttps://www.thetriplex.org/movie/the-only-living-pickp
 ocket-in-new-york\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/western
 ma/
URL:https://www.thetriplex.org/movie/the-only-living-pickpocket-in-new-york
END:VEVENT
