SUMMARY:Showgirls
LOCATION:Triplex Cinema\, 70 Railroad St\, Great Barrington\, MA 01230
DESCRIPTION:Queer Cinema Club Berkshires and No Comply Foods are teaming up
  for a screening of the ultimate so-bad-its-amazing cult movie: Paul Verho
 even's Showgirls! Arriving in Las Vegas with nothing more than a suitcase 
 and a dream\, Nomi (Elizabeth Berkley) works her way up from a seedy strip
 club to dancing at the high-profile Stardust Hotel\, with an eye on taking
  the lead role from marquee dancer Cristal (Gina Gershon) in this erotical
 ly excessive spin on All About Eve.\nhttps://www.thetriplex.org/movie/show
 girls\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.thetriplex.org/movie/showgirls
